      "steps": [
        {
          "title": "Construct the original actual resolvent before choosing cutoffs",
          "text": "Consume LocalizedWeakResolvent on the SAME original closable exact compact-gradient graph. Its ONE u retains every local-volume/ordinary weak equation and every C2 cutoff equation. Set G=D.closureu and a=f-epsilon*u in genuine weighted L2. Do not assume the unlocalized inner(gradientW,G) or ordinary PDE residual is globally weighted L2.",
