          "formula": "\\chi_nG\\to G,\\quad\\chi_na\\to a\\quad\\text{in }L^2(\\mu).",
          "lean": "bounded_coefficient_memLp; norm_sq_integral; bounded_coefficient_tendsto_zero; dominated_L2_tendsto_zero; actual_cutoff_function_convergence"
