          "formula": "A_{\\chi_n}=\\chi_na-2\\langle\\nabla\\chi_n,G\\rangle+c_nu\\to a,\\quad G_{\\chi_n}\\to G.",
          "lean": "actual_cutoff_commutators; global_coercivity_from_localization"
